  "methodology": "All cases earn the actual opening party, equipment and loadout through earnOpening(), then use the canonical enemy, context, floor and combat-order driver. No HP, damage, rewards or gear are added. The only independent variable in matched controls is the fresh encounterTempo version marker. The first-threat policy redirects the queued earned Earth at the announced damaging strike. Guard responds once with the first threatened ready hero. Dodge is an idealized 50ms geometry-aware per-hero movement policy, not a human playtest. Menus, cinematic pauses, pointer input, Ground Forge and Living Atlas modifiers are outside this simulation.",
